"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-08-19T16:45:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T19:58:51Z","closed_at":"2025-08-20T19:55:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.3, 4.4.0, 4.4.1\n\n\n### System information\n\nApple M1 Pro - macOS Sequoia 15.6 - Godot 4.4.1 - WebOS 22 Simulator - WebOS 22 TV\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe web export fails to run on WebOS 22 TV and simulator and it outputs the below error, and the same export runs fine on the WebOS 25 simulator.\n\n## Error from the WebOS simulator inspector:\n```\nUncaught (in promise) CompileError: WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming(): unexpected section <Exception> @+74939\n```\n\n## Screenshot from the WebOS 22 simulator:\n<img width=\"1408\" height=\"1077\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33316bd3-ea9d-4c55-a5cc-88e095b5040c\" />\n\n## Screenshot from the WebOS 25 simulator for the same export:\n<img width=\"1409\" height=\"952\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3924bf2c-45a2-4e4e-81b5-f78b139ed320\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a test project in Godot\n2. Export to web using the default values\n3. Add the `appinfo.json` in the web export directory\n  ```\n{\n  \"id\": \"com.randombundle.tvtest\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"vendor\": \"My Company\",\n  \"type\": \"web\",\n  \"main\": \"tv_test.html\",\n  \"title\": \"Godot4 Test\",\n  \"icon\": \"tv_test.png\",\n  \"largeIcon\": \"tv_test.png\"\n}\n  ```\n5. Run on WebOS 22 simulator or WebOS 22 TV\n  ```\n❯ ares-launch -s 22 -sp webOS_TV_22_Simulator_1.4.1 path/to/web/export\n\n❯ ares-launch -s 25 -sp webOS_TV_25_Simulator_1.4.2 path/to/web/export\n  ```\n5. The scene will not load for WebOS 22\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21860104/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109781/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"